{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/b20ad05eda46e23cd13e7f3c1e0ba814.poster.avif?t=1763944700\" width=630 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/b20ad05eda46e23cd13e7f3c1e0ba814.webm?t=1763944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/b20ad05eda46e23cd13e7f3c1e0ba814.mp4?t=1763944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death of a Wish</strong> is a vicious action-RPG where <strong>style is salvation</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Christian as he unites with new comrades to challenge the order that raised him. By taking down the four Sanctum Faiths: Father, Sister, Cardinal, and Priest, they will upend the order of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a nightmare filled with horrifying monsters and terrifying people. Master brutal attacks and flashy combos as you struggle against the Corruption consuming you with style and grace. Shine your light in this surreal sea of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/760879b96854c737acb5154f057b2388.webp?t=1763944700\" width=614 height=47 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN VICIOUSLY GRACEFUL COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash Christian\u2019s cursed powers in a demanding and rewarding combat system. Be careful not to succumb to the ever-encroaching Corruption; achieve high ranks in combat and perform graceful combos to hold the Corruption at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR MARKED POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rend your foes asunder with magical combos called Arias. Enhance your abilities with powerful Virtues that alter your approach to battle and the rhythm of combat. With a limitless array of ways to fight stylishly, build your character with passion to destroy your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND INTO THE NIGHTMARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dreamworld of Paradiso, repressed memories and unspeakable feelings come to life as the nightmarish city of Neo-Sanctum. Delve into the secret underworld of the esoteric and abandoned to meet new comrades who will aid you on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURREAL AND SPECTACULAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christian\u2019s world is rendered with a surreal aesthetic like no other. Harsh, pulsating scratches upon a sea of darkness render a thick atmosphere brooding with emotion. Battles come to life in an animated spectacle of light and motion that remains easy to parse in play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For audio, Nicolo Telesca\u2019s chilling score mixes electronic sounds with live instrumentation and complements the visuals by eliciting feelings of tense anxiety and electrifying catharsis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/2e9771457318cf8b8dc59a80e9c7d00b.poster.avif?t=1763944700\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/2e9771457318cf8b8dc59a80e9c7d00b.webm?t=1763944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302080/extras/2e9771457318cf8b8dc59a80e9c7d00b.mp4?t=1763944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. See content warnings below. </i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wistful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/81d7abc8773c13763da51c603f8edb2b826751c1.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/5ff24f33fd0b5935cf45bdb3bf6ece92b2801376.jpg"},{"name":"Loved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/7feac7f130ebd82f08a07805254e8e1e794480a5.jpg"},{"name":"Sing the Sorrow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/6efabe50fc31ea6de673813306ebdb464b5b158e.jpg"},{"name":"Obstinate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/7a8590bbd1c79f89d1f3f9c4e14f2c5df792e949.jpg"},{"name":"The Outsider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/fa901e721c79a7d27c1280b08e33ec25cd11d654.jpg"},{"name":"Lebaron...Memorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/fc2de26bc4307f5a1e78234420f1eb296dfe5c9f.jpg"},{"name":"Garden of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/2be63d0bcfdd392c8615823fac62ec16e69e0109.jpg"},{"name":"Passenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/6d8a6be2a1f35c2f57b3a935695974a16fc089ed.jpg"},{"name":"Deliverance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302080/e6b08a46cf537b10b83a0e07b150828426130002.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2302080?t=17639447